[{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1436","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1436.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1267","title":"KDE 文件管理器 kfm TCP 服务器远程文件修改漏洞","description":"KDE 桌面环境的文件管理器 kfm 使用 TCP 套接字进行进程间通信，监听本地 TCP 端口处理文件操作命令。远程攻击者可通过向该 TCP 服务器发送 copy 命令，将任意文件复制到目标用户主目录下的 .rhosts 文件，从而获得远程访问权限。攻击条件为攻击者能够通过网络访问 kfm 监听的 TCP 端口，且目标系统上运行了 kfm 服务。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1267"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"1997-05-05T00:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T00:00:00Z","remediation":"将 kfm 的进程间通信方式从 TCP 套接字改为 AF_UNIX 域套接字，并正确设置套接字文件权限为仅本地用户可访问，避免远程攻击者直接连接 kfm 服务端口。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=87602167420906&w=2","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/1646"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1436.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1484","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1484.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1380","title":"Symantec Norton Utilities ActiveX 远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Symantec Norton Utilities 2.0 for Windows 95 中的 TUNEOCX.OCX ActiveX 控件被错误标记为对脚本安全，远程攻击者可通过恶意网页诱导用户使用 Internet Explorer 3.0 等浏览器访问，利用该控件的 run 选项执行任意命令。该漏洞影响 Norton Utilities 2.0 版本，攻击条件为用户访问恶意网页，危害为任意命令执行，CVSS 评分 5.1，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.1,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1380"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1997-05-04T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:18Z","remediation":"在 Internet Explorer 中将 TUNEOCX.OCX 控件的 CLSID（如 {00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001}，须确认实际 CLSID）注册 kill bit，阻止浏览器调用该控件；或使用 regsvr32 /u TUNEOCX.OCX 注销该 ActiveX 控件；升级至 Norton Utilities 3.0 及以上版本以彻底解决此问题。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["http://mlarchive.ima.com/win95/1997/May/0342.html","http://news.zdnet.co.uk/story/0%2C%2Cs2065518%2C00.html","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/7188.php","http://www.net-security.sk/bugs/NT/nu20.html","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/36911ad057245f7d02822794db0f459d9b4c9b8f/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1380.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1380","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/470a5f1c0d1bd36cd0a6327cda49cf96a1474588/content/CVE-1999-1380.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/3012e5f1cf9bcfe839897275a956236aed334269/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1380.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/664f1b641010bd1f3bc1d11a60ca29d1f4a0e4ca/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-rr53-c8w6-c9v3/GHSA-rr53-c8w6-c9v3.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-1380.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--2040d301-6d31-4604-96d0-5b7f45aed99c.json","https://github.com/Ethishh/securin_assessment/blob/e6ce9197b6593ae46f3f5646d268181eea6cbb31/cve_sync.log","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/8108bbe4fb0e20671face287a302a062844c09bb/1999.tsv","https://github.com/Vasileios-Mavroeidis/semantic-stix-vulnerability/blob/30f07606133364b9623f401bc306c8c9cbcf9386/vulnerability/vulnerability--2040d301-6d31-4604-96d0-5b7f45aed99c.owl"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/1999/POC-AVE-1999-1484.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1484.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1338","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1338.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1116","title":"SGI IRIX Indigo Magic系统管理员子系统本地权限提升漏洞","description":"SGI IRIX 6.3 及 6.4 版本的 Indigo Magic 系统管理子系统中的 runpriv 组件存在权限许可与访问控制漏洞。本地攻击者可通过利用该组件对特权操作的不当权限检查，以低权限用户身份执行本应需要 root 权限的操作，从而获取系统最高权限。该漏洞影响 SGI IRIX 6.3 和 6.4 版本，CVSS 评分 7.2，危害等级高。攻击者需拥有本地系统访问权限方可利用。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1116"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1997-05-03T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:49:45Z","remediation":"立即应用 SGI 安全公告 19970503-01-PX 提供的补丁，或升级至 IRIX 6.5 及以上版本。如无法升级，可临时移除 runpriv 的 setuid 位（chmod u-s /usr/sysadmin/runpriv），并严格限制本地用户登录权限，仅允许受信任的管理员账户访问系统。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-19T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.osvdb.org/1009","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/462","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/2108","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/a662dc905cd549a2105daacbfce64cf01652761d/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1116.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1116","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/5cf8ba64f356efe9269b21eca2f657231acd746c/content/CVE-1999-1116.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/263f37bc67cd24fe03a39077d8b57f3001369a95/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1116.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/bf2339193e1c10dc2db330718adeb8cc8d88c4dd/advisories/unreviewed/2022/05/GHSA-fmxx-7f4h-f834/GHSA-fmxx-7f4h-f834.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-1116.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--7a5a7ce5-baab-4311-a1f1-c80ac8c3aa51.json","https://github.com/Yuning-J/VulnerabilityClassifier/blob/c0f06c21b73c26b5ee2b75c21a498eb04eada4b5/threatPrediction/cveIDThreatType/cve_idgainpre","https://github.com/hungryfoolou/Vulnerability_Mining/blob/3df1d8ed0489ae1228f975ae1f58a690aae53886/craw/cveid_craw/cveid_craw/data/cveid_by_kind/cveid_gainpre.txt","https://github.com/Ethishh/securin_assessment/blob/e6ce9197b6593ae46f3f5646d268181eea6cbb31/cve_sync.log"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1338.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0253","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0253.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0112","title":"IBM AIX CDE dtterm 本地缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"AIX 4.2 系统中的 CDE 桌面环境 dtterm 程序存在本地缓冲区溢出漏洞。未授权本地攻击者可通过向 dtterm 程序传递特制的超长参数触发缓冲区溢出，覆盖函数返回地址，从而以 root 权限执行任意代码。该漏洞要求攻击者拥有系统本地账号，影响 AIX 4.2 版本及可能更早版本，CVSS 评分 7.2，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0112"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"1997-05-01T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:47:36Z","remediation":"建议升级至 AIX 4.3 及以上版本，或安装 IBM 提供的相应 APAR 补丁。临时缓解措施可移除 /usr/dt/bin/dtterm 的 setuid 权限（chmod u-s /usr/dt/bin/dtterm），并限制可执行该程序的用户组，仅授权可信用户访问 CDE 环境。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-14T00:00:00Z","references":["https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/878","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/333","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/297eb115816d3735806f02ee33bb4d2d53ecd5c6/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0112.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-0112","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-redhat/blob/601a95d57be2a57306cd88389c2251f34b2fbcc1/csaf-vex/1999/cve-1999-0112.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/9074597bd191efd66c2a6bf1f5d8e60bc4801a90/content/CVE-1999-0112.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/2ed73314b4d66512efbb22e0644e615bc00001f2/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-0112.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/49899a53e9c2e620c99e0234afe3c50e512ad851/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-3xqj-xx96-hm93/GHSA-3xqj-xx96-hm93.json","https://github.com/feng-li/tools-for-data-science-course/blob/8e62d47ee8ffbebe9a0e50aee193617f83883118/2019spring/2017312271/result.txt","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x84000/83084/info.html","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/d21eb36f6164170df89822577def7df5351966d2/nvdcve/CVE-1999-0112.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0253.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0102","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0102.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0040","title":"多厂商 X Window System libXt 库本地缓冲区溢出权限提升漏洞","description":"X Window System 的 Xt 库中存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，本地攻击者可利用 libXt 库中 XtAppInitialize() 函数的溢出缺陷，通过精心构造的输入触发内存破坏，从而获取 root 权限执行任意命令。该漏洞影响 BSD/OS、FreeBSD、HP-UX、AIX、IRIX、SunOS、UnixWare 等多种 Unix 系统，CVSS 评分 7.2，危害等级高。由于利用条件仅需本地访问，在多用户环境下威胁较大，已有公开的 xterm 利用代码。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0040"],"sources":["cve","exploitdb"],"published":"1997-05-01T00:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T00:00:00Z","remediation":"升级各厂商已修复的 X11 发行版：FreeBSD 升级至 2.2.5 及以上版本或 3.x，HP-UX 安装 HP 对应安全补丁，AIX 安装 IBM APAR 对应补丁，IRIX 升级至 6.5 及以上版本并安装 SGI 安全补丁，Solaris 安装 Sun 对应补丁簇。如无法升级，移除所有 setuid root 的 X11 程序（如 /usr/bin/X11/xterm）的 suid 权限作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-14T08:41:11Z","references":[],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0102.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1460","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1460.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1296","title":"MIT Kerberos 缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"Kerberos V 中所集成的 Kerberos IV 兼容库存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，本地用户可通过 KRB_CONF 环境变量指定包含超长内容的 kerberos 配置文件路径，造成缓冲区溢出，成功利用此漏洞可获得系统的 root 权限。该漏洞使低权限本地用户能够完全控制受影响的系统，广泛影响部署了 Kerberos V 并启用 Kerberos IV 兼容模式的网络认证环境。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1296"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1997-04-29T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:08Z","remediation":"立即将 Kerberos V 升级至 1.0 patch level 1 或更高版本，可从 MIT 官网获取更新。OpenBSD 用户应更新至 OpenBSD-current 并重新编译 Kerberos 库。如无法升级，移除 setuid/setgid 的 Kerberos IV 兼容程序，并在系统层面禁用 KRB_CONF 环境变量传递。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=87602167420878&w=2","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/24df5d59670dfe04b9c86de11fa86df63c0d28f7/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1296.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1296","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/470a5f1c0d1bd36cd0a6327cda49cf96a1474588/content/CVE-1999-1296.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/228df6a85079f5c6b1ecdfb3d41be685458438ef/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1296.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/4544d3857250fe21711ce8febf38e8822729678f/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-crq7-q2h2-v5r9/GHSA-crq7-q2h2-v5r9.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/39f1db26eec9899ab2f8110ab3b45424c6fe9ec2/nvdcve/CVE-1999-1296.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_154300_154400.json","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_000155.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/dd9f81e9fd85457bf78c55783cb6a31e9af71d63/1999.tsv","https://github.com/Yuning-J/NVDFeatureAnalysis/blob/493a57a415cc110f9945148abd717eeb92f6ca7e/originalDataset/cveIDThreatType/cve_idgainpre"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1460.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0103","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0103.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0038","title":"BSD xlock 缓冲区溢出本地代码执行漏洞","description":"BSD 操作系统中 xlock 屏幕锁定程序存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。本地攻击者可通过向 xlock 程序发送特制的超长输入数据触发缓冲区溢出，从而覆盖内存中的执行流程，实现以 root 权限执行任意命令。该漏洞影响多个 BSD 衍生系统，攻击者需要拥有本地系统访问权限，无需认证即可利用，CVSS 评分 8.4，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.4,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0038"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1997-04-26T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:47:25Z","remediation":"升级 xlock 至 xlockmore 2.5 及以上版本，或从操作系统厂商获取对应补丁（Sun 补丁 ID 10145）。在无法升级的环境中，限制不可信用户本地登录权限，移除 xlock 的 setuid root 权限位以阻止提权，或使用其他屏幕锁定工具替代。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-13T00:00:00Z","references":["https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/CVE-1999-0038"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0103.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0304","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0304.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0149","title":"SGI IRIX cgi-bin wrap 目录遍历漏洞","description":"SGI IRIX 6.2 系统中的 cgi-bin wrap 程序存在目录遍历漏洞，远程攻击者可通过在 URL 参数中使用 `..`（点点）序列绕过路径限制，访问并列出服务器上任意目录的内容。该漏洞无需身份认证即可利用，可导致敏感文件信息泄露，例如系统配置文件、用户数据等。攻击条件简单，仅需目标系统运行存在漏洞的 wrap CGI 程序即可实施。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0149"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"1997-04-19T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:47:42Z","remediation":"建议升级至 SGI IRIX 6.3 及以上版本，或直接移除系统 cgi-bin 目录下的 wrap CGI 脚本。若无法升级，在 Web 服务器（如 Netscape FastTrack）配置中严格限制 cgi-bin 目录访问权限，并禁用路径穿越（..）与目录列表功能以作临时缓解。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-14T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.osvdb.org/247","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/373","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/290","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19298","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/ab669d9fb37e52ed0619cb2b8265d34528fbe875/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0149.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-0149","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-redhat/blob/601a95d57be2a57306cd88389c2251f34b2fbcc1/csaf-vex/1999/cve-1999-0149.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/9074597bd191efd66c2a6bf1f5d8e60bc4801a90/content/CVE-1999-0149.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/2f876a2c24d5ccd5bbd081f09e801e580536456a/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-0149.json","https://github.com/stg-tud/cveenhance/blob/6476e73d87cdc9cf610342ef15d131432ab41588/Annotations/UnAnnotated/CVE-1999-0149.xml","https://github.com/NetBSD/pkgsrc-wip/blob/9e4b769742ed57395763142c26029c2f9910f15b/sara/PLIST","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/snort/drop-rules/web-cgi.rules","https://github.com/blackhook/nessus-plugins/blob/64177d96abbb07c58cf7e131046b067ebc61fcb5/W/wrap.nasl","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0304.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0149","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0149.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0058","title":"PHP CGI 缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"PHP 的 CGI 程序 php.cgi 存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。攻击者可通过向目标系统发送特制的 HTTP 请求触发该溢出，导致内存损坏，从而获得目标服务器的 shell 访问权限。该漏洞影响早期版本的 PHP，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。建议用户升级至最新版本以修复此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0058"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1997-04-17T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:47:28Z","remediation":"立即升级至修复了 CGI 缓冲区溢出问题的 PHP 3.0.1 或更高版本；若无法升级，在 Apache 配置中通过 `<FilesMatch \"php\\.cgi\"> Deny from all </FilesMatch>` 禁用 php.cgi 的外部直接访问，并改用 mod_php 模块方式运行 PHP 脚本以消除 CGI 攻击面。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-13T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/712"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0149.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1462","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1462.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1298","title":"FreeBSD Sysinstall 匿名FTP配置信息泄露漏洞","description":"FreeBSD 2.2.1 及更早版本中的 Sysinstall 工具在配置匿名 FTP 服务时存在信息泄漏漏洞。当管理员通过 Sysinstall 设置匿名 FTP 时，系统会自动创建 ftp 用户且未设置密码，并将该用户的登录 shell 设置为 /bin/date，导致攻击者可利用此配置缺陷绕过身份认证获取系统资源访问权限。该漏洞影响 FreeBSD 2.2.1 及之前版本，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。建议升级至不受影响版本或手动修正 ftp 用户配置以降低风险。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1298"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1997-04-07T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:08Z","remediation":"升级至 FreeBSD 2.2.1 以上版本，该漏洞已在后续版本中修复。如无法升级，手动删除无密码的 ftp 用户或将 ftp 用户的 shell 改为 /sbin/nologin，并为其设置强密码，同时限制匿名 FTP 的目录访问权限。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/7537.php","http://www.osvdb.org/6087","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/851a313c6bc1948d5487aca773aa21ade52b7c28/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1298.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1298","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/470a5f1c0d1bd36cd0a6327cda49cf96a1474588/content/CVE-1999-1298.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/929f101fd7b4d4314a4b92f62a8cc2523c6d76f0/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1298.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/491d1a908ffff7b174e17aaac4d0207c13405fa7/advisories/unreviewed/2022/05/GHSA-jgrm-9wvf-g8j4/GHSA-jgrm-9wvf-g8j4.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x88000/87795/info.html","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-1298.json","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_000153.txt","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--b08d5461-8778-408a-8d17-7d2fc91959cf.json","https://github.com/Ethishh/securin_assessment/blob/e6ce9197b6593ae46f3f5646d268181eea6cbb31/cve_sync.log"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1462.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0105","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0105.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0042","title":"华盛顿大学 IMAP 与 POP 服务器缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"华盛顿大学实现的 IMAP 和 POP 服务器中存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过向运行 imapd 服务的 Linux 系统发送特制请求触发该漏洞，导致缓冲区溢出，进而造成远程代码执行或任意文件读取。该漏洞影响使用华盛顿大学实现 IMAP/POP 协议套件的 Linux 系统，危害等级严重。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0042"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"1997-04-07T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:47:26Z","remediation":"升级 UW IMAP 至 4.5 及以上版本，该版本修复了 imapd 及 popd 中的缓冲区溢出漏洞。如无法升级，建议禁用 IMAP/POP 服务，改用 SSH 隧道加密访问邮件，或在防火墙层面限制对 143/110 端口的访问作为临时缓解。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-14T00:00:00Z","references":["https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/CVE-1999-0042","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/340","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/2765cfa5d0fc39151c354509f5ba2b7abfdb61de/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0042.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-0042","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-redhat/blob/601a95d57be2a57306cd88389c2251f34b2fbcc1/csaf-vex/1999/cve-1999-0042.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/9074597bd191efd66c2a6bf1f5d8e60bc4801a90/content/CVE-1999-0042.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/37da04e8698400cbfe936368ce494fc186159eb4/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-0042.json","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/snort/drop-rules/imap.rules","https://github.com/blackhook/nessus-plugins/blob/64177d96abbb07c58cf7e131046b067ebc61fcb5/I/imap_overflow.nasl","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x84000/83099/info.html","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/97009c469920f4d8991128f84d19644c3badca15/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-00xx/CVE-1999-0042.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0105.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1488","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1488.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1387","title":"Microsoft Windows NT 4.0 SMB Mount 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Windows NT 4.0 SP2 的 SMB 挂载功能存在输入验证缺陷，远程攻击者可通过向目标系统发送特制的畸形数据包（例如在 Linux 2.0.29 内核编译但在 2.0.25 内核执行的 smbmount 命令所生成的数据包）触发该漏洞，导致目标系统崩溃并拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 Windows NT 4.0 SP2 及更早版本，CVSS 评分 5.0，危害等级中等。微软已发布安全更新修复此漏洞。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1387"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1997-04-02T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:19Z","remediation":"Windows NT 4.0 已停止支持，官方不再提供安全更新。建议尽快升级至受支持的 Windows Server 版本（如 Windows Server 2019/2022）。临时缓解措施：在防火墙层面禁用 SMB 端口（TCP 139/445），或停止 Server 服务（net stop server）。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=87602167420731&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=87602167420732&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=87602167420741&w=2","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/36911ad057245f7d02822794db0f459d9b4c9b8f/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1387.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1387","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/470a5f1c0d1bd36cd0a6327cda49cf96a1474588/content/CVE-1999-1387.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/3012e5f1cf9bcfe839897275a956236aed334269/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1387.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/664f1b641010bd1f3bc1d11a60ca29d1f4a0e4ca/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-wv39-w6w5-mrhr/GHSA-wv39-w6w5-mrhr.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/39f1db26eec9899ab2f8110ab3b45424c6fe9ec2/nvdcve/CVE-1999-1387.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_154300_154400.json","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_000152.txt","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--7e944f75-b550-4377-93b5-55fb241a60ff.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/4e87ecc1abc33575c55e11407fc842c718c9d6cb/1999.tsv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1488.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0527","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0527.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0315","title":"Sun Solaris 2.4 /bin/fdformat 本地缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"Solaris 2.4 系统中的 /bin/fdformat 命令存在本地缓冲区溢出漏洞。由于该命令在处理用户输入时未对缓冲区边界进行有效检查，本地攻击者可通过向 fdformat 程序提交特制的参数触发缓冲区溢出，从而覆盖进程内存空间并执行任意代码。成功利用此漏洞可使普通用户获得 root 权限，完全控制受影响的系统。该漏洞需要攻击者拥有本地系统访问权限，无法远程利用。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0315"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"1997-04-01T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:48:08Z","remediation":"安装 Sun 针对此漏洞发布的安全补丁（对应 Sun Security Bulletin #138），或升级到 Solaris 2.5.1 及以上版本。如无法升级，立即执行 `chmod 0755 /bin/fdformat` 移除 fdformat 的 setuid root 权限位，阻止普通用户以 root 权限执行该程序。同时限制可访问 fdformat 的用户组，仅授权管理员使用。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-16T00:00:00Z","references":["http://sunsolve.sun.com/pub-cgi/retrieve.pl?doctype=coll&doc=secbull/138","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/328","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/6df16fc0c02ccadd2d0fbb0029e3db345d75f1c8/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0315.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-0315","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/45be3b4afd9c4397ee32a5cbf6819a590220b0c1/content/CVE-1999-0315.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/8c57fab4f71bd6fdcec1202e5361e2a9805c4950/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-0315.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/6eca843f42fd99fea8c9b630931afac7c9d4576c/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-988q-hp2f-8wq8/GHSA-988q-hp2f-8wq8.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-0110.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_153100_153200.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_3.list.dict","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/8cadbdd1cf5feac22fead0cb1d1fdbe2acdfa0e6/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-03xx/CVE-1999-0315.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0527.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0486","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0486.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0292","title":"Microsoft Windows NT 4.0 Winpopup 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Microsoft Windows NT 4.0 的 Winpopup（信使服务）在处理用户名字段时存在输入验证缺陷，远程攻击者可向目标系统发送包含超长用户名的弹出消息触发该漏洞，导致目标系统耗尽系统资源或信使服务崩溃，造成拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 Windows NT 4.0 系统，无需身份认证即可远程利用，攻击复杂度较低，CVSS 评分 5.0，危害等级中等。Microsoft 官方未发布针对此漏洞的安全补丁。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0292"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1997-04-01T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:48:05Z","remediation":"安装 Windows NT 4.0 Service Pack 6a (SP6a) 以修复 Winpopup 消息处理中的缓冲区问题。如系统已不受支持，建议立即升级至受支持的 Windows Server 版本，或在防火墙和本地安全策略中禁用 Messenger 服务（net stop messenger）。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-14T00:00:00Z","references":["https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/CVE-1999-0292","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/1421f0a4349d5d46275cadd9c7c62349edf9c8bb/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0292.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-0292","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-li